MNI ICBM 2009 nonlinear templates (Fonov et al.)
------------------------------------------------
``resources/templates/space/MNI152NLin2009bAsym/res-1mm/{t1,t2}.nii.gz`` are the
MNI ICBM 2009b nonlinear asymmetric T1w and T2w templates, reduced to a 1.0 mm
grid by taking every second voxel of the original 0.5 mm image (no interpolation,
no change of the stored intensities). ``brainmask.nii.gz`` beside them is the
ICBM 2009c brain mask carried onto that grid through the cached 2009c -> 2009b
template registration (linear, threshold 0.5). ``scripts/build_shipped_template.py``
documents the derivation and ``template.json`` beside the files records the
checksums. The other ICBM 2009 variants offered for download are not
redistributed with Wyss DBS Localizer.

  Source: https://www.bic.mni.mcgill.ca/~vfonov/icbm/2009/mni_icbm152_nlin_asym_09b_nifti.zip
  Atlas page: https://nist.mni.mcgill.ca/icbm-152-nonlinear-atlases-2009/

